<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Recycling Project: Expression Explorer</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --green: #2f9e44;
    --green-dark: #1f7a35;
    --green-light: #ebfbee;
    --red: #e03131;
    --red-light: #fff0f0;
    --blue: #1971c2;
    --blue-light: #eaf3fc;
    --purple: #7048e8;
    --ink: #22303a;
    --muted: #6b7c85;
    --card: #ffffff;
    --bg: #f4f8f5;
    --radius: 14px;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: 'Segoe UI', 'Noto Sans KR', Arial, sans-serif;
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, #eafcef 0%, #f4f8f5 40%, #eef6ff 100%);
    color: var(--ink);
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 16px;
  }
  #app {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 780px;
    background: var(--card);
    border-radius: 20px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(30, 80, 50, 0.12);
    overflow: hidden;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    min-height: 640px;
  }
  header {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--green), #40b95a);
    color: white;
    padding: 18px 22px 14px;
  }
  header h1 { margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 1.25rem; }
  header p.sub { margin: 0; font-size: 0.85rem; opacity: 0.92; }
  .home-btn-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .home-btn {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
    color: white;
    padding: 6px 12px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .home-btn:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.35); }
  .home-btn.active { background: white; color: var(--green-dark); }
  .progress-track { display: flex; gap: 6px; margin-top: 14px; }
  .progress-seg { flex: 1; height: 6px; border-radius: 4px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.35); overflow: hidden; }
  .progress-seg.done, .progress-seg.active { background: white; }
  .stage-label { font-size: 0.72rem; margin-top: 6px; opacity: 0.9; }
  main { padding: 22px; flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .stage { display: none; flex: 1; flex-direction: column; }
  .stage.visible { display: flex; }
  h2 { font-size: 1.1rem; margin: 0 0 10px; color: var(--green-dark); }
  .instructions {
    background: #f1f8f2;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--green);
    padding: 10px 14px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .instructions .kr { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.82rem; display: block; margin-top: 2px; }
  .passage {
    background: var(--green-light);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 16px 18px;
    line-height: 1.9;
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .expr { font-weight: 700; color: var(--green-dark); background: #d3f9d8; padding: 1px 5px; border-radius: 6px; }
  .meaning-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 10px; }
  @media (max-width: 520px) { .meaning-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .meaning-card { background: #fff; border: 1.5px solid #dceee0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px 12px; }
  .meaning-card .phrase { font-weight: 700; color: var(--green-dark); font-size: 0.95rem; }
  .meaning-card .def { font-size: 0.83rem; color: var(--ink); margin-top: 3px; }
  .meaning-card .kr { font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 3px; }

  .match-wrap { display: flex; gap: 14px; flex: 1; }
  .match-col { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
  .match-btn {
    text-align: left; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 10px; border: 2px solid #d7e8db;
    background: white; cursor: pointer; font-size: 0.88rem; transition: all 0.15s ease; line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .match-btn:hover:not(.matched):not(:disabled) { border-color: var(--green); }
  .match-btn.selected { border-color: var(--blue); background: #eaf3fc; }
  .match-btn.matched { background: var(--green-light); border-color: var(--green); color: var(--green-dark); cursor: default; opacity: 0.85; }
  .match-btn.wrong-flash { animation: shake 0.35s; border-color: var(--red); background: var(--red-light); }
  @keyframes shake { 0%,100% { transform: translateX(0); } 25% { transform: translateX(-4px); } 75% { transform: translateX(4px); } }

  .fill-passage { background: var(--green-light); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 16px 18px; line-height: 2.4; font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .blank {
    display: inline-block; min-width: 100px; padding: 3px 10px; margin: 0 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--blue);
    background: #fff; border-radius: 6px 6px 0 0; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; color: var(--blue); text-align: center;
  }
  .blank.empty::after { content: '?????'; color: #c3d3c8; letter-spacing: 2px; }
  .blank.correct { border-color: var(--green); background: var(--green-light); color: var(--green-dark); }
  .blank.incorrect { border-color: var(--red); background: var(--red-light); color: var(--red); }
  .blank .fix { display: block; font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 400; color: var(--green-dark); }
  .word-bank { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; padding: 12px; background: #f6f6f6; border-radius: 10px; min-height: 50px; }
  .bank-word {
    padding: 8px 14px; border-radius: 20px; border: 2px solid #cfd8dc; background: white; cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 0.88rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); transition: all 0.15s ease;
  }
  .bank-word:hover:not(:disabled) { border-color: var(--blue); }
  .bank-word.selected { background: var(--blue); color: white; border-color: var(--blue); }
  .bank-word:disabled { opacity: 0.25; cursor: default; }

  .mc-question { background: #fbfbfb; border: 1.5px solid #e4e9e6; border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .mc-question .qnum { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .mc-question .sentence { font-size: 0.96rem; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.5; }
  .mc-options { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 8px; }
  @media (max-width: 480px) { .mc-options { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .mc-opt { padding: 9px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1.5px solid #d7e0dc; background: white; cursor: pointer; font-size: 0.86rem; text-align: left; }
  .mc-opt:hover:not(:disabled) { border-color: var(--blue); }
  .mc-opt.chosen { border-color: var(--blue); background: #eaf3fc; }
  .mc-opt.correct-answer { border-color: var(--green); background: var(--green-light); color: var(--green-dark); font-weight: 700; }
  .mc-opt.wrong-chosen { border-color: var(--red); background: var(--red-light); color: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .mc-opt:disabled { cursor: default; }

  .btn-row { margin-top: auto; padding-top: 18px; display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .btn { padding: 11px 22px; border-radius: 24px; border: none; font-size: 0.92rem; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; transition: transform 0.1s ease; }
  .btn:active { transform: scale(0.97); }
  .btn:disabled { opacity: 0.5; cursor: not-allowed; }
  .btn-primary { background: var(--green); color: white; }
  .btn-primary:disabled { background: #c9d8cc; cursor: not-allowed; }
  .btn-secondary { background: #eef2ef; color: var(--ink); }
  .btn-purple { background: var(--purple); color: white; }
  .btn-blue { background: var(--blue); color: white; }
  .hint-msg { font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--muted); align-self: center; margin-right: auto; }

  .result-hero { text-align: center; padding: 10px 0 20px; }
  .result-hero .score-circle {
    width: 130px; height: 130px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: conic-gradient(var(--green) var(--pct, 0%), #e6efe8 0);
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin: 0 auto 14px;
  }
  .score-circle-inner { width: 104px; height: 104px; border-radius: 50%; background: white; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
  .score-circle-inner .num { font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--green-dark); }
  .score-circle-inner .lbl { font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--muted); }
  .result-msg { font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .recap-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; margin-top: 10px; }
  .recap-item { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; background: #f6f9f6; padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .recap-item b { color: var(--green-dark); }

  /* ---------- FLASHCARDS ---------- */
  .fc-topbar { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:14px; }
  .fc-counter { font-size:0.85rem; color:var(--muted); font-weight:600; }
  .fc-scene { perspective: 1200px; margin-bottom: 16px; flex:1; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; }
  .fc-card {
    width: 100%; max-width: 500px; min-height: 300px; position: relative;
    transform-style: preserve-3d; transition: transform 0.5s; cursor: pointer;
  }
  .fc-card.flipped { transform: rotateY(180deg); }
  .fc-face {
    position: absolute; inset: 0; backface-visibility: hidden;
    border-radius: 16px; padding: 22px; display:flex; flex-direction:column;
    align-items:center; justify-content:center; text-align:center;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); border: 2px solid #d7e8db;
  }
  .fc-face.front { background: linear-gradient(160deg,#ffffff,#eefaf0); }
  .fc-face.back { background: linear-gradient(160deg,#eef5ff,#ffffff); transform: rotateY(180deg); }
  .fc-phrase { font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--green-dark); margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .fc-phonetic { font-size: 1rem; color: var(--purple); font-family: 'Segoe UI', monospace; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .fc-hint { font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 14px; }
  .fc-def { font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight:700; color: var(--blue); margin-bottom:10px; }
  .fc-examples { font-size: 0.85rem; line-height:1.6; color: var(--ink); text-align:left; }
  .fc-examples div { margin-bottom:6px; }
  .fc-examples b { color: var(--green-dark); }

  .fc-controls { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px; justify-content:center; margin-bottom:14px; }
  .fc-audio-btn {
    background: var(--blue); color:white; border:none; border-radius:20px; padding:9px 16px;
    font-size:0.82rem; font-weight:700; cursor:pointer; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;
  }
  .fc-audio-btn:hover { background:#155a9c; }
  .speed-select {
    padding: 8px 10px; border-radius: 20px; border: 1.5px solid #cfd8dc; font-size:0.8rem; font-weight:600; background:white;
  }

  .pron-box {
    background:#f7f5ff; border:1.5px solid #ddd4fb; border-radius:12px; padding:14px; margin-bottom:14px;
  }
  .pron-box h3 { margin:0 0 8px; font-size:0.9rem; color: var(--purple); }
  .mic-btn {
    background: var(--purple); color:white; border:none; border-radius:20px; padding:9px 18px;
    font-size:0.85rem; font-weight:700; cursor:pointer; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;
  }
  .mic-btn.recording { background: var(--red); animation: pulse 1s infinite; }
  @keyframes pulse { 0%,100%{opacity:1;} 50%{opacity:0.6;} }
  .pron-result { margin-top:10px; font-size:0.85rem; }
  .pron-score { font-weight:800; font-size:1.1rem; }
  .pron-score.good { color: var(--green-dark); }
  .pron-score.mid { color:#e8850c; }
  .pron-score.low { color: var(--red); }
  .pron-heard { color:var(--muted); font-size:0.8rem; margin-top:4px; }

  .fc-nav { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:10px; margin-top:auto; padding-top:12px; }

  /* ---------- ASSESSMENT HUB ---------- */
  .assess-menu { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:12px; }
  @media (max-width:520px){ .assess-menu{ grid-template-columns:1fr; } }
  .assess-card {
    background:white; border:2px solid #dceee0; border-radius:14px; padding:16px; cursor:pointer; text-align:left;
    transition: all 0.15s ease;
  }
  .assess-card:hover { border-color: var(--green); transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .assess-card .ic { font-size:1.6rem; margin-bottom:6px; }
  .assess-card .ttl { font-weight:800; color:var(--green-dark); font-size:0.95rem; margin-bottom:3px; }
  .assess-card .desc { font-size:0.78rem; color:var(--muted); }

  .spell-item { background:#fbfbfb; border:1.5px solid #e4e9e6; border-radius:12px; padding:14px 16px; margin-bottom:14px; }
  .spell-item .prompt { font-size:0.95rem; margin-bottom:8px; }
  .spell-item .prompt b { color: var(--green-dark); }
  .spell-input {
    width:100%; padding:10px 12px; border-radius:8px; border:1.5px solid #cfd8dc; font-size:0.9rem;
  }
  .spell-input.correct { border-color: var(--green); background: var(--green-light); }
  .spell-input.incorrect { border-color: var(--red); background: var(--red-light); }
  .spell-feedback { margin-top:6px; font-size:0.83rem; font-weight:700; }
  .spell-feedback.correct { color: var(--green-dark); }
  .spell-feedback.incorrect { color: var(--red); }

  /* ---------- IMAGE GAME ---------- */
  .img-scene-wrap { position:relative; width:100%; border-radius:14px; overflow:hidden; margin-bottom:14px; background:#eef6ff; }
  .img-scene { width:100%; height:auto; display:block; }
  .img-hotspot {
    position:absolute; border:3px solid transparent; border-radius:10px; cursor:pointer;
    transition: all 0.15s ease;
  }
  .img-hotspot:hover { border-color: rgba(25,113,194,0.5); }
  .img-hotspot.correct { border-color: var(--green); background: rgba(47,158,68,0.25); }
  .img-hotspot.incorrect { border-color: var(--red); background: rgba(224,49,49,0.25); }
  .img-game-audio-row { display:flex; justify-content:center; margin-bottom:12px; }

  .retake-banner {
    background:#fff4e6; border:1.5px solid #ffd8a8; color:#a15c00; padding:10px 14px;
    border-radius:10px; font-size:0.85rem; margin-bottom:14px; font-weight:600;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="app">
  <header>
    <h1>🌱 Recycling Project: Expression Explorer</h1>
    <p class="sub">Learn 6 useful English expressions · about 10–15 minutes</p>
    <div class="home-btn-row">
      <button class="home-btn active" id="navMain" onclick="goHome('main')">📘 Main Activity</button>
      <button class="home-btn" id="navFlash" onclick="goHome('flash')">🃏 Flashcards</button>
      <button class="home-btn" id="navAssess" onclick="goHome('assess')">🧪 Assessment</button>
      <button class="home-btn" id="navImg" onclick="goHome('imggame')">🖼️ Picture Game</button>
    </div>
    <div class="progress-track" id="progressTrack"></div>
    <div class="stage-label" id="stageLabel">Step 1 of 5: Learn</div>
  </header>

  <main>

    <!-- STAGE 1: LEARN -->
    <section class="stage visible" id="stage-learn">
      <h2>📖 Step 1. Read the story</h2>
      <div class="instructions">
        Read the passage below. The six target expressions are highlighted. Then check their meanings.
        <span class="kr">아래 글을 읽어보세요. 6개의 표현이 강조되어 있습니다. 그 다음 의미를 확인하세요.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="passage">
        A group of students wanted to <span class="expr">find out</span> how much waste their school produced each day. They decided to <span class="expr">set up</span> recycling boxes for paper and plastic. They also asked classmates to <span class="expr">sort out</span> their waste carefully. At first, many students did not <span class="expr">pay attention to</span> the recycling signs, so the team <span class="expr">came up with</span> a simple points game. With more students joining the project, the team was able to <span class="expr">carry out</span> the plan for an entire month.
      </div>
      <div class="meaning-grid" id="meaningGrid"></div>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <button class="btn btn-purple" onclick="goHome('flash')">🃏 Study Flashcards First</button>
        <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="goToStage(1)">Next: Matching Game →</button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- STAGE 2: MATCH -->
    <section class="stage" id="stage-match">
      <h2>🔗 Step 2. Match the expression to its meaning</h2>
      <div class="instructions">
        Tap an expression, then tap its correct meaning. Matched pairs turn green.
        <span class="kr">표현을 먼저 누르고, 알맞은 뜻을 누르세요. 맞으면 초록색이 됩니다.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="match-wrap">
        <div class="match-col" id="matchLeftCol"></div>
        <div class="match-col" id="matchRightCol"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <span class="hint-msg" id="matchHint">Matched: 0 / 6</span>
        <button class="btn btn-primary" id="matchNextBtn" onclick="goToStage(2)" disabled>Next: Fill in the Blanks →</button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- STAGE 3: FILL -->
    <section class="stage" id="stage-fill">
      <h2>✏️ Step 3. Fill in the blanks</h2>
      <div class="instructions">
        Tap a word from the word bank, then tap a blank in the story to place it. Tap a filled blank to undo.
        <span class="kr">단어 은행에서 단어를 누른 다음, 이야기의 빈칸을 눌러 채우세요.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="fill-passage" id="fillPassage"></div>
      <div class="word-bank" id="wordBank"></div>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <span class="hint-msg" id="fillHint"></span>
        <button class="btn btn-primary" id="checkFillBtn" onclick="checkFill()" disabled>Check Answers</button>
        <button class="btn btn-primary" id="fillNextBtn" style="display:none" onclick="goToStage(3)">Next: Apply →</button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- STAGE 4: APPLY -->
    <section class="stage" id="stage-apply">
      <h2>🎯 Step 4. Use the expressions in new sentences</h2>
      <div class="instructions">
        Choose the best expression to complete each new sentence.
        <span class="kr">각 새로운 문장에 가장 알맞은 표현을 고르세요.</span>
      </div>
      <div id="mcContainer"></div>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <span class="hint-msg" id="mcHint"></span>
        <button class="btn btn-primary" id="submitMcBtn" onclick="checkMc()" disabled>Submit Answers</button>
        <button class="btn btn-primary" id="mcNextBtn" style="display:none" onclick="goToStage(4)">See My Results →</button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- STAGE 5: RESULT -->
    <section class="stage" id="stage-result">
      <h2>🏁 Great job!</h2>
      <div class="result-hero">
        <div class="score-circle" id="scoreCircle">
          <div class="score-circle-inner">
            <div class="num" id="scoreNum">0/12</div>
            <div class="lbl">SCORE</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="result-msg" id="resultMsg"></div>
        <div style="font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--muted)" id="resultSub"></div>
      </div>
      <h2 style="font-size:1rem;">Quick recap</h2>
      <div class="recap-list" id="recapList"></div>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <button class="btn btn-purple" onclick="goHome('flash')">🃏 Review Flashcards</button>
        <button class="btn btn-blue" onclick="goHome('assess')">🧪 Try Assessment</button>
        <button class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="location.reload()">🔄 Try Again</button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FLASHCARDS SECTION -->
    <section class="stage" id="stage-flash">
      <h2>🃏 Flashcards</h2>
      <div class="instructions">
        Tap the card to flip it. Use the buttons to hear pronunciation and try recording your own voice.
        <span class="kr">카드를 눌러 뒤집으세요. 버튼으로 발음을 듣고 직접 녹음해 보세요.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="fc-topbar">
        <span class="fc-counter" id="fcCounter">Card 1 / 6</span>
        <span class="fc-counter">Tap card to flip 👆</span>
      </div>
      <div class="fc-scene">
        <div class="fc-card" id="fcCard" onclick="flipCard()">
          <div class="fc-face front">
            <div class="fc-phrase" id="fcPhraseFront"></div>
            <div class="fc-hint">Tap to see meaning & examples</div>
          </div>
          <div class="fc-face back">
            <div class="fc-phrase" id="fcPhraseBack" style="font-size:1.2rem;"></div>
            <div class="fc-phonetic" id="fcPhonetic"></div>
            <div class="fc-def" id="fcDef"></div>
            <div class="fc-examples" id="fcExamples"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="fc-controls">
        <button class="fc-audio-btn" onclick="event.stopPropagation(); playCardAudio()">🔊 Listen to Pronunciation</button>
        <select class="speed-select" id="speedSelect" onclick="event.stopPropagation()">
          <option value="0.6">0.6x</option>
          <option value="0.8">0.8x</option>
          <option value="1.0" selected>1.0x (default)</option>
          <option value="1.2">1.2x</option>
          <option value="1.5">1.5x</option>
        </select>
      </div>
      <div class="pron-box" onclick="event.stopPropagation()">
        <h3>🎙️ Pronunciation Practice</h3>
        <button class="mic-btn" id="micBtn" onclick="event.stopPropagation(); toggleRecording()">🎤 Start Recording</button>
        <div class="pron-result" id="pronResult"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="fc-nav">
        <button class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="prevCard()">← Previous</button>
        <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="nextCard()">Next →</button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ASSESSMENT HUB -->
    <section class="stage" id="stage-assess-menu">
